      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It is the oldest settlement in the Monongahela River Valley and probably the oldest in Washington County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofmonongahela-pa.gov/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The name Monongahela comes from a Native American word meaning 'falling banks'.",
